# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:5
translate chinese daySevenStart_968d65a1:

    # mc "I am the {b}{i}only{/i}{/b} Enforcer here, [ella]. [clarissa] is within my jurisdiction, and under my control. You {b}will not{/b} lay a hand on her, nor anyone else on this campus."
    mc "我才是{b}{i}唯一{/i}{/b}的执法者，[ella]。[clarissa]在我的管辖范围内，受我掌控。你{b}休想{/b}碰她，也别想动这校园里的任何人。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:7
translate chinese daySevenStart_5c404254:

    # ella "She works for me. I scraped her up from the hellhole I found her in and molded her into who she is today."
    ella "她是我捡回来的狗。从阴沟里拎出来，一点一点训成现在这样。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:8
translate chinese daySevenStart_e6c56382:

    # ella "She is mine to do with as I see fit. Moreover, get off my ar-"
    ella "她归我处置，我想怎样就怎样。另外，从我的地界上——"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:10
translate chinese daySevenStart_56e39d31:

    # mc "You see. This is the issue, isn't it?"
    mc "看吧。问题就在这，不是吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:11
translate chinese daySevenStart_8e276de2:

    # mc "Just because you found her and trained her to be your puppy dog, doesn't mean you can treat her like this."
    mc "就算是你捡到她、把她训成自己的狗，也不代表你就能这样对她！"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:14
translate chinese daySevenStart_bbeeeb21:

    # "[ella] tries to swing her arm free from your grasp, but as a result you grip her wrist tighter, letting her know that you're not messing around."
    "[ella]猛地扭动手臂想挣脱你的控制，但你反而更用力地抓住她的手腕——这下她该明白，你可不是在跟她闹着玩。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:17
translate chinese daySevenStart_a77c8f30:

    # mcT "This is rough. I want to know why [ella] smacked [clarissa] but it's not appropriate right now. [clarissa]'s still distraught. It's clearly still too fresh."
    mcT "这下麻烦了。我想知道[ella]为什么对[clarissa]动手，但眼下问并不合适。[clarissa]还惊魂未定，显然没从这打击里缓过来。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:18
translate chinese daySevenStart_7c8590ce:

    # mcT "I'll wait until she's calmed down and ask what's going on..."
    mcT "等她情绪平复些……再问清原委也不迟……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:20
translate chinese daySevenStart_fc2f563c:

    # mc "[clarissa]."
    mc "[clarissa]。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:21
translate chinese daySevenStart_cf24824a:

    # clarissa "..."
    clarissa "……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:23
translate chinese daySevenStart_2f8a8951:

    # clarissa "Y-yes, sir?"
    clarissa "是、是的，先生？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:25
translate chinese daySevenStart_a686de8b:

    # mc "Are you okay? Do you need anything?"
    mc "你还好吗？需要帮忙吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:28
translate chinese daySevenStart_70cb2c18:

    # "[clarissa] scurries behind you, your body acting as an emotional and physical shield between her and her would-be abuser."
    "[clarissa]颤抖着躲到你身后，你的身躯如同一道屏障，将她与那个意图伤害她的人彻底隔开——既是肉体的阻隔，也是心理的庇护。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:31
translate chinese daySevenStart_ad424676:

    # "She softly clenches onto your shirt as she peeks around your shoulder, sheepishly looking into your eyes."
    "她轻轻攥住你的衣角，从你肩后怯怯探出半张脸，湿漉漉的眼睛小心望向你。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:33
translate chinese daySevenStart_7286abb1:

    # clarissa "I'm.. I'm fine... {size=-10}now{/size}."
    clarissa "我……我很好……{size=-10}现在{/size}。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:34
translate chinese daySevenStart_0a56b6b9:

    # clarissa "Th-thank you."
    clarissa "谢、谢谢你。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:36
translate chinese daySevenStart_cebe9df0:

    # mc "Of course, [clarissa]. Remember the promise I made to you?"
    mc "当然，[clarissa]。还记得我对你的承诺吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:38
translate chinese daySevenStart_cf24824a_1:

    # clarissa "..."
    clarissa "……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:40
translate chinese daySevenStart_99dc476c:

    # clarissa "I remember."
    clarissa "我记得。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:42
translate chinese daySevenStart_8fe6c46a:

    # mc "You have nothing to worry about."
    mc "你什么都不用担心。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:44
translate chinese daySevenStart_81ae5654:

    # mc "You, on the other hand..."
    mc "至于你……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:46
translate chinese daySevenStart_7a605221:

    # mc "You kept mentioning '[theDirector]'. Has he signed off on how you treat your assistants?"
    mc "你老是把[theDirector]挂在嘴边。他批准过你这样对待助手吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:48
translate chinese daySevenStart_83d0d8b6:

    # ella "Who do you think you are? You do not have the right to interrogate me on anything I do for the benefit of Sinergy."
    ella "你以为自己是谁？我为星聚能做的事，轮不到你来指手画脚！"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:49
translate chinese daySevenStart_c2421f96:

    # ella "You really don't know your place; It's such a shame. It seems I'm going to have to teach you, first hand, how respect is earned."
    ella "你真是认不清自己的位置……真是可惜。看来我得亲手教教你，什么叫尊重。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:51
translate chinese daySevenStart_e8d07bc7:

    # ella "{i}This{/i} is not the right way to go about it."
    ella "{i}这{/i}不是正确的方法。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:53
translate chinese daySevenStart_880e2bf5:

    # ella "Now, before I go and make the call, let go of my arm."
    ella "现在，在我打电话之前——先松开我的手臂。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:55
translate chinese daySevenStart_662ad355:

    # mc "Oh, I'll let go, after you've said a specific word."
    mc "行啊，我会松手——等你说出那个「关键词」之后。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:56
translate chinese daySevenStart_1ebb0529:

    # mc "An important word. Not to me, no. To [clarissa]."
    mc "是某个重要的词，不是对我说，而是对[clarissa]。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:58
translate chinese daySevenStart_0625fdd3:

    # "[ella] scoffs at what you're insinuating."
    "[ella]对你话里的暗示嗤之以鼻。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:60
translate chinese daySevenStart_acb4bea0:

    # iris "Lady [ella]... I... I think it's best if we go..."
    iris "[ella]夫人……我……我们最好先离开……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:62
translate chinese daySevenStart_482defae:

    # iris "[clarissa] did something bad, I get it. But we don't want things to get any worse."
    iris "[clarissa]确实做错了事，我明白。但我们不想让事情变得更糟。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:64
translate chinese daySevenStart_2ff29311:

    # mc "I don't think we're done here. Not until you acknowledge the boundaries you've crossed."
    mc "我认为这事还没完。除非你承认自己越界了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:66
translate chinese daySevenStart_906e0724:

    # ella "You're testing me far beyond my patience, and I don't take kindly to it. Respect is something you {i}earn{/i}, but maybe I'll just have to {i}take{/i} it instead."
    ella "你正在挑战我耐心的极限——而我向来不喜欢这样。尊重本该是{i}赢来{/i}的，但现在看来，我只能亲手{i}夺{/i}过来了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:69
translate chinese daySevenStart_0caae063:

    # "[ella] tries to pull away again, but your grip is too tight for her to wiggle out of. You continue standing your ground."
    "[ella]再次试图挣脱，可你握得太紧，她根本使不上劲。你依旧站在原地，寸步不让。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:72
translate chinese daySevenStart_22fe7553:

    # mc "Maybe respect starts with an apology, one she deserves. You can {i}start{/i} with [clarissa]'s."
    mc "尊重，不妨从一句道歉开始——[clarissa]应得的那句。你可以{i}先{/i}还给她。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:74
translate chinese daySevenStart_8e1a08f0:

    # "She scoffs, her anger flaring."
    "[ella]冷笑一声，怒火陡然升腾。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:76
translate chinese daySevenStart_b4d2c4ea:

    # ella "You think a pathetic demand is going to make me-"
    ella "你以为这种可笑的命令能让我——"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:79
translate chinese daySevenStart_94d2a86d:

    # iris "Lady [ella], please... We should go. We don't want things to get any worse."
    iris "[ella]夫人，求你了……我们该走了。事情不能再糟下去了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:85
translate chinese daySevenStart_479eac2b:

    # "Iris glances nervously at [clarissa], then glides across to you."
    "艾瑞丝紧张地瞥了[clarissa]一眼，然后快步挪到你身边。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:86
translate chinese daySevenStart_b09f038b:

    # "Her eyes shimmer with unease, a clear plea to end the tension hanging in the air."
    "她眼里闪着不安，分明是在恳求赶紧结束这僵持的气氛。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:87
translate chinese daySevenStart_7e9fdb02:

    # "It's clear that an apology from [ella] isn't coming. Pushing for one would be as futile as hitting a brick wall."
    "显然，[ella]是不会道歉的。继续逼她道歉，就像用头撞墙一样徒劳。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:89
translate chinese daySevenStart_3ff4eec5:

    # mc "{size=-10}*Sigh*{/size}"
    mc "{size=-10}*叹气*{/size}"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:92
translate chinese daySevenStart_6dfb3fb0:

    # "You reluctantly releases [ella]'s arm but continue to hold her gaze."
    "你不情愿地松开了[ella]的手臂，却仍死死盯着她的双眼。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:94
translate chinese daySevenStart_96ec9ce4:

    # mc "Think about what this kind of 'respect' gets you. And what it costs."
    mc "好好想想这种所谓「尊重」能给你带来什么——以及你要为此付出什么代价。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:96
translate chinese daySevenStart_fa5bdb41:

    # "[ella], simmering, pulls back without a word, her expression hardened but shaken. [iris] gives you a grateful look."
    "[ella]强压怒火，一言不发地退开，她的表情冷硬却带着动摇。[iris]向你投来感激的目光。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:98
translate chinese daySevenStart_61cf1153:

    # "After a tense moment, [ella] straightens herself, brushing off the moment like an inconvenience."
    "片刻的僵持后，[ella]挺直身子，像甩掉个麻烦似的把刚才的冲突抛到脑后。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:100
translate chinese daySevenStart_02dbde5c:

    # ella "Fine. I won't waste any more time here."
    ella "行。我不在这多耗了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:102
translate chinese daySevenStart_d1a1785e:

    # ella "[iris], [clarissa], we're going. Now."
    ella "[iris]，[clarissa]，现在我们走。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:104
translate chinese daySevenStart_801b44ee:

    # "[clarissa] bows her head sheepishly in compliance."
    "[clarissa]顺从地低下头，脸上带着几分局促不安。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:106
translate chinese daySevenStart_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:108
translate chinese daySevenStart_0276965d:

    # mc "You're not getting away from me that easily."
    mc "你别想就这么轻易走掉。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:110
translate chinese daySevenStart_59010158:

    # "[clarissa] freezes, her eyes wide with surprise, unsure whether to defy [ella] or stand by you."
    "[clarissa]僵在原地，双眼因震惊而睁大，一时拿不定主意是该违抗[ella]还是该站在你这边。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:112
translate chinese daySevenStart_89a5f234:

    # ella "And who exactly do you think you are? Employees listen, and do as they're told. You don't have authority here."
    ella "你以为自己算老几？员工就该乖乖听话照做。在这可轮不到你发号施令。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:114
translate chinese daySevenStart_9af06238:

    # mc "Maybe not in title. But I don't need one to see what's happening here, and I won't let you intimidate her into compliance."
    mc "名义上或许没资格，但看清眼前的事还用不着什么头衔——我绝不会让你威逼她就范。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:116
translate chinese daySevenStart_38427213:

    # ella "Oh, how noble of you. Playing the hero, are we? You can't protect her forever."
    ella "哈，好高尚啊！在这扮演英雄呢？你护得了她一时，护不了一世。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:118
translate chinese daySevenStart_11d9faf7:

    # mc "Maybe I can't. But I can stand in the way right now. And that's all you need to understand."
    mc "或许护不了一世——但至少现在，我挡在这。这一点，你最好记清楚了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:120
translate chinese daySevenStart_57756b5d:

    # "[ella], with her signature scoff, realizes that pushing further might create more spectacle than she's willing to handle. She motions to [iris], who hesitates but nods, moving to [ella]'s side."
    "[ella]标志性地冷哼一声，意识到继续纠缠只会让场面更难堪。她朝[iris]使了个眼色——后者虽有些迟疑，还是点头站到了[ella]身边。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:123
translate chinese daySevenStart_6427e853:

    # ella "This isn't over, boy. Stay in your lane. Do your job, and remember who is in charge here."
    ella "这事没完，小子。摆正自己的位置，干好你的本分——最好牢牢记住这谁说了算。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:131
translate chinese daySevenStart_f7a0b6d9:

    # iris "Awe babes, are you okay??"
    iris "哎呀宝贝，你没事吧？？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:133
translate chinese daySevenStart_429faced:

    # clarissa "Mm... Yeah... I'm okay, I think. It's just... starting to feel normal, you know?"
    clarissa "嗯……没事……我大概还好吧。只是……都开始觉得这是正常的事了，懂吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:135
translate chinese daySevenStart_65f2b663:

    # mcT "Normal? She said that like it's something she's accepted..."
    mcT "正常？她说这话的语气……像是已经认命了……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:136
translate chinese daySevenStart_5a6c366e:

    # mcT "How many times has this happened to her?"
    mcT "这种事……她到底经历过多少次了？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:137
translate chinese daySevenStart_a6625650:

    # mcT "No. This ends here."
    mcT "不。到此为止了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:138
translate chinese daySevenStart_7f087340:

    # mcT "She's under my protection now, and I won't let anyone hurt her again. I can't afford a 'what if' here."
    mcT "现在她由我保护，我绝不会让任何人在这里再伤害她。我赌不起任何「万一」。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:139
translate chinese daySevenStart_0254ce09:

    # mcT "Luckily, it looks like she has friends at Sinergy to pick her up."
    mcT "幸好，看样子她在星聚能还有朋友会送她一程。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:141
translate chinese daySevenStart_a4597814:

    # mc "I take it your name is [iris]?"
    mc "我猜……你叫[iris]？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:152
translate chinese daySevenStart_bda6aee3:

    # iris "You would be correct, {color=[d7_mc_name_color]}Enforcer [d7_no_prefix_name!t]{/color}."
    iris "你说得没错，{color=[d7_mc_name_color]}执法者 [d7_no_prefix_name!t]{/color}。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:154
translate chinese daySevenStart_ece2c3c6:

    # iris "You would be correct, Enforcer [d7_no_prefix_name!t]."
    iris "你说得没错，执法者 [d7_no_prefix_name!t]。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:156
translate chinese daySevenStart_6d9b4a85:

    # mcT "Cute smile. Braces too."
    mcT "笑得挺可爱呢，还戴着牙套。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:158
translate chinese daySevenStart_a01f3cb4:

    # iris "[clarissa] speaks very highly of you."
    iris "[clarissa]对你可是赞不绝口呢。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:159
translate chinese daySevenStart_611d7f8a:

    # mc "Oh, does she?"
    mc "哦，是吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:161
translate chinese daySevenStart_22c07272:

    # iris "I hope you're treating her correctly."
    iris "希望你待她好点。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:163
translate chinese daySevenStart_f4d7cb87:

    # mc "Absolutely. [clarissa] is my partner, and my responsibility now."
    mc "当然。[clarissa]现在是我的搭档，也是我要负责的人。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:164
translate chinese daySevenStart_63785f05:

    # mc "I was hoping you could answer a few questions for me?"
    mc "我想请你回答几个问题，可以吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:166
translate chinese daySevenStart_d4f28a7a:

    # iris "If it's quick. I can't stay for long, or else I'll be punished for wasting her time."
    iris "问题不多的话。我不能待太久，不然她会因为耽误时间罚我。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:168
translate chinese daySevenStart_f1b1e4a2:

    # iris "Well... More than I already will... I... I confronted- I put my on hands her..."
    iris "唉……反正横竖都要受罚了……我……我当面顶撞了——我还对她动手了……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:170
translate chinese daySevenStart_83179372:

    # mc "So did I..."
    mc "我也……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:172
translate chinese daySevenStart_aba3bc60:

    # iris "I'm surprised she didn't contact [theDirector] right then and there and fire you."
    iris "她居然没当场联系[theDirector]把你辞退，这点倒是出乎我意料。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:173
translate chinese daySevenStart_a32602c0:

    # iris "What was it you wanted to ask of me?"
    iris "你想问我什么？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:175
translate chinese daySevenStart_916303db:

    # mc "You've mostly answered it already. I wanted to confirm if she's like this to all of her assistants."
    mc "你基本已经回答我了。我只是想确认，她是不是对所有助理都这样。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:176
translate chinese daySevenStart_fa288fa5:

    # mc "And by the sounds of it, that is indeed the case."
    mc "听你这么说，看来确实如此了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:177
translate chinese daySevenStart_1565549d:

    # mc "Does this 'Director' know what she does?"
    mc "那位[theDirector]知道[ella]平时都干些什么吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:179
translate chinese daySevenStart_40471eba:

    # iris "I can't say for certain. But, if I may speculate..."
    iris "我不能断言。但要让我猜的话……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:180
translate chinese daySevenStart_9b1aed4c:

    # iris "[theDirector] is at the very top. They know everything. I find it hard to believe they wouldn't be aware of her actions."
    iris "[theDirector]身居高位，对一切都了如指掌。要说他们毫不知情……我实在难以相信。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:181
translate chinese daySevenStart_1cca3b27:

    # iris "[ella] is one of their right-hands, after all."
    iris "毕竟[ella]可是他们的左膀右臂。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:182
translate chinese daySevenStart_2fa1b330:

    # iris "She manages the Enforcers in this district specifically."
    iris "她专门负责这个片区的执法者事务。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:184
translate chinese daySevenStart_0d0e122c:

    # mcT "District?"
    mcT "片区？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:185
translate chinese daySevenStart_7b7d8eb3:

    # mc "Not across the entire country?"
    mc "不是全国范围？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:187
translate chinese daySevenStart_6e6972da:

    # iris "No, not the country. Think of it like a pyramid. [theDirector] gives orders to [ella] and others at her level, and they carry them out."
    iris "不，不是全国范围。你就想象成一座金字塔：[theDirector]向[ella]这一级别的人下达指令，再由她们具体执行。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:188
translate chinese daySevenStart_5571ae9f:

    # iris "They all have their own areas, and funnel it all back to [theDirector]."
    iris "她们各管一摊，最后全都汇总到[theDirector]那里。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:190
translate chinese daySevenStart_a56ee232:

    # mcT "I guess [clarissa] must have miss spoke the other day."
    mcT "看来[clarissa]那天应该是说错了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:192
translate chinese daySevenStart_358f316e:

