    mc "去看看狼怎么样了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1648
translate chinese D7_Morgana_350b3cfb:

    # clarissa "Okay, sir!"
    clarissa "好吧，先生！"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1654
translate chinese D7_Morgana_c1977735:

    # "You arrive to your office, but the door is laced with construction tape..."
    "你回到办公室，却发现门上缠满了施工胶带……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1657
translate chinese D7_Morgana_7135770c:

    # "Beyond the door, soft snarls of the Apex rise above the steady drone of machinery and the clatter of moving furniture."
    "门后传来[apex]的低吼，盖过机器运转和家具移动的嘈杂。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1658
translate chinese D7_Morgana_c8805901:

    # mcT "If he hurts Coco... I swear I'll-"
    mcT "如果他伤害可可……我发誓要——"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1659
translate chinese D7_Morgana_3a3d97c3:

    # mcT "You know what, I wouldn't do anything. I'd just be sad. He's much bigger than me."
    mcT "算了，我什么也做不了。只会伤心。他比我庞大多了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1660
translate chinese D7_Morgana_2a0e6ac4:

    # mcT "Gotta pick my fights strategically."
    mcT "打哪一仗，得挑准了再动手。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1661
translate chinese D7_Morgana_89ea6115:

    # mcT "Though, I guess that parcel will have to wait until tomorrow."
    mcT "不过那个包裹得明天才能取了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1662
translate chinese D7_Morgana_7821cc7b:

    # mcT "If it even survives until tomorrow. I'm sure Apex is hating it right about now."
    mcT "要是它能撑到明天的话。我敢说[apex]现在恨死它了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1663
translate chinese D7_Morgana_d7cf275f:

    # mcT "I'll need to check the courtyard in the morning to make sure it's not been flung out of the window..."
    mcT "明早我得去检查一下院子，确认她没被扔出窗外……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1664
translate chinese D7_Morgana_b37c9a84:

    # mc "He's definitely not a slacker, that's for sure."
    mc "他绝对不是懒鬼，这点可以肯定。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1668
translate chinese D7_Morgana_28382997:

    # clarissa "Yeah..."
    clarissa "是的……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1671
translate chinese D7_Morgana_d9d67a38:

    # mc "What's the matter?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1673
translate chinese D7_Morgana_03b5fcb0:

    # clarissa "I had a plan. Like... in my head..."
    clarissa "我本来是有计划的。就是在……脑子里盘算过……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1675
translate chinese D7_Morgana_c9a6cc53:

    # clarissa "You stepped in, stopped [ella], and now, well, here I am."
    clarissa "你出手拦下了[ella]，然后……嗯，就变成现在这样了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1678
translate chinese D7_Morgana_c544f421:

    # clarissa "My plan was to spend the night in your office, on the sofa or something."
    clarissa "我本打算在你办公室凑合一晚，睡睡沙发之类的。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1680
translate chinese D7_Morgana_bd5a33f1:

    # clarissa "My plan was to spend the night in your office, on the couch or something."
    clarissa "我本打算在你办公室凑合一晚，睡睡沙发之类的。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1682
translate chinese D7_Morgana_05339fb8:

    # clarissa "But I guess that's not going to happen now."
    clarissa "但现在看来不行了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1684
translate chinese D7_Morgana_df83a7f2:

    # "[clarissa] peers around the corridor, and notices the big open space in front of her."
    "[clarissa]环顾四周的走廊，注意到面前那片宽敞的空间。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1687
translate chinese D7_Morgana_a3d3c32c:

    # clarissa "I'll make the floor here all nice and cosy, and wait for your return tomorrow morning, sir."
    clarissa "我会把这块地板弄暖和些，铺个舒服的窝，然后等你明早回来，先生。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1690
translate chinese D7_Morgana_b50514d1:

    # mc "What are you saying?"
    mc "你在说什么？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1692
translate chinese D7_Morgana_cc8a1d7d:

    # clarissa "What do you mean, sir?"
    clarissa "你是什么意思，先生？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1694
translate chinese D7_Morgana_645e0f25:

    # mc "You don't think I'd actually accept that?"
    mc "你不会真以为我会接受吧？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1696
translate chinese D7_Morgana_c13f68c7:

    # mc "Even if my office was usable, I wouldn't let you sleep on the sofa."
    mc "就算我办公室能用，我也不会让你睡沙发。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1698
translate chinese D7_Morgana_1bcafba7:

    # mc "Even if my office was usable, I wouldn't let you sleep on the couch."
    mc "就算我的办公室能用，我也不会让你睡沙发。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1699
translate chinese D7_Morgana_b9465a1d:

    # mc "When I {i}insisted{/i} that you wouldn't be leaving here with [ella], it was because I intended to offer you a proper bed."
    mc "我之所以{i}坚持{/i}不让[ella]带你走，就是打算给你一张正经的床。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1700
translate chinese D7_Morgana_cf24824a_6:

    # clarissa "..."
    clarissa "……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1702
translate chinese D7_Morgana_27e62277:

    # clarissa "I'm sorry, sir. I don't understand. There aren't any beds here..?"
    clarissa "抱歉，先生。我不明白。这里没有床啊……？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1705
translate chinese D7_Morgana_cbf9345e:

    # mc "Then come stay at my place for the night?"
    mc "那今晚来我家住？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1706
translate chinese D7_Morgana_df95a68f:

    # mc "You can sleep in my bed, and I'll take the sofa."
    mc "你可以睡我的床，我睡沙发。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1708
translate chinese D7_Morgana_cbf9345e_1:

    # mc "Then come stay at my place for the night?"
    mc "那今晚来我家住？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1709
translate chinese D7_Morgana_a3b5b49d:

    # mc "You can sleep in my bed, and I'll take the couch."
    mc "你可以睡我的床，我睡沙发。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1711
translate chinese D7_Morgana_d7f5f2ba:

    # clarissa "But sir, I... I don't even know where you live..."
    clarissa "可是先生，我……我都不知道你住哪儿……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1713
translate chinese D7_Morgana_90fee094:

    # mc "No, [clarissa] I..."
    mc "不，[clarissa]，我……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1715
translate chinese D7_Morgana_070430ee:

    # mc "Hhh... I don't mean the sofa in my office..."
    mc "呃……我说的不是办公室的沙发……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1716
translate chinese D7_Morgana_47a53b33:

    # mc "The sofa at my house..."
    mc "是我家的沙发……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1718
translate chinese D7_Morgana_cb657a5d:

    # mc "Hhh... I don't mean the couch in my office..."
    mc "呃……我说的不是办公室的沙发……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1719
translate chinese D7_Morgana_9556ad67:

    # mc "The couch at my house..."
    mc "是我家的沙发……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1721
translate chinese D7_Morgana_10d70fbd:

    # clarissa "Ahh... What??"
    clarissa "啊……什么？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1723
translate chinese D7_Morgana_2339cb03:

    # clarissa "Y-you want me to go back to your house with you..?"
    clarissa "你、你要我跟你回家……？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1725
translate chinese D7_Morgana_66cbfff2:

    # clarissa "... It's... It's too soon..."
    clarissa "……这……太快了……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1735
translate chinese D7_Morgana_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1736
translate chinese D7_Morgana_cf24824a_7:

    # clarissa "..."
    clarissa "……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1737
translate chinese D7_Morgana_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1738
translate chinese D7_Morgana_f5a82569:

    # mc "What's too soon?"
    mc "什么太快了？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1740
translate chinese D7_Morgana_f2e22afe:

    # clarissa "{size=-10}{i}*Cute Cough*{/i}{/size}"
    clarissa "{size=-10}{i}*可爱地咳嗽*{/i}{/size}"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1742
translate chinese D7_Morgana_94200e3f:

    # clarissa "I mean... I can't possibly intrude into your personal space, your home, sir!"
    clarissa "我是说……我不能随便闯进你的私人空间，你的家啊，先生！"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1744
translate chinese D7_Morgana_44cdff2a:

    # clarissa "I'll sleep right over there!"
    clarissa "我就睡那边好了！"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1746
translate chinese D7_Morgana_08372bf5:

    # clarissa "It's fine! I'll find a blanket or something. You don't need to worry about me!"
    clarissa "没事的！我找条毯子什么的，你不用操心我！"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1748
translate chinese D7_Morgana_e259520d:

    # clarissa "You've already done too much for me..."
    clarissa "你今天为我做得已经够多了……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1750
translate chinese D7_Morgana_94563855:

    # mc "And what are you going to wear, [clarissa]? You don't have clothes, and I doubt there'll be blankets here. You can't seriously think sleeping on the floor here is an option."
    mc "那你穿什么呢，[clarissa]？你连换洗的衣服都没有，这里也不可能有毯子。你该不会真想睡地板吧。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1751
translate chinese D7_Morgana_7ec7616f:

    # mc "I'm not leaving you with nothing. That's not what you deserve. That's not how I do things."
    mc "我不会丢下你，让你什么都没有。那不是你该得的，更不是我的作风。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1753
translate chinese D7_Morgana_6f8c01c8:

    # clarissa "But-"
    clarissa "但是——"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1755
translate chinese D7_Morgana_41094a72:

    # mc "No 'but.' You're coming with me, and that's final."
    mc "没有「但是」。你跟我走，这事就这么定了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1756
translate chinese D7_Morgana_19b32fae:

    # mc "You'll have a warm bed and a proper place to sleep."
    mc "你会有张暖和的床，有个正经的过夜的地方。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1758
translate chinese D7_Morgana_f750fa75:

    # clarissa "Sir, I really don't want to impose-"
    clarissa "先生，我真的不想给你添麻烦——"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1760
translate chinese D7_Morgana_1f1a4bca:

    # mc "You're not imposing. It's the least I can do after everything you've been through this afternoon."
    mc "这不算打扰。今天下午你经历了这么多，这点事是我起码该做的。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1761
translate chinese D7_Morgana_99089e82:

    # mc "If you want to repay me, start by letting me help you without feeling guilty about it."
    mc "你真想报答我，就先别带着愧疚接受我的帮助。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1763
translate chinese D7_Morgana_4964a6a1:

    # clarissa "...I-okay. If you're sure, sir..."
    clarissa "……好、好的……如果你确定的话，先生……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1765
translate chinese D7_Morgana_6bf96aff:

    # mc "I'm sure. Now, let's go before you try to convince yourself to sleep on the floor again."
    mc "我确定。现在走吧，免得你又想说服自己睡地板。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1766
translate chinese D7_Morgana_7066a166:

    # mc "On the way I need to stop by the store real quick."
    mc "路上我得顺道去趟商店。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1769
translate chinese D7_Morgana_4dbd2dd9:

    # clarissa "The store? What for, sir?"
    clarissa "商店？买什么，先生？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1776
translate chinese D7_Morgana_c4813017:

    # mc "Just some essentials..."
    mc "就些必需品……"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1797
translate chinese D7_Morgana_20a6652e:

    # ella "Where's the usual security?"
    ella "平时那个保安呢？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1799
translate chinese D7_Morgana_e9ea36b0:

    # klop_maria "In the hospital, Mistress. He had an accident with a door. Resulting in 205 broken bones."
    klop_maria "在医院，夫人。他被门夹了，断了 205 根骨头。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1801
translate chinese D7_Morgana_87c60921:

    # ella "{i}Again?{/i}"
    ella "{i}又来？{/i}"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1802
translate chinese D7_Morgana_3f694be1:

    # ella "What about the other one?"
    ella "另一个呢？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1804
translate chinese D7_Morgana_72ea3483:

    # klop_maria "Sitting at his bedside, Ma'am."
    klop_maria "正在他的病床边守着，夫人。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1806
translate chinese D7_Morgana_3d0674ea:

    # ella "Then how are you the one guarding [theDirector]'s door? You're just a maid."
    ella "那怎么是你在守[theDirector]的门？你只是个女仆。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1808
translate chinese D7_Morgana_0f23c515:

    # klop_maria "I'm tougher than I look, Mistress. You should have no worries on his well-being."
    klop_maria "我比看起来能扛，夫人。他的安危，你完全不必担心。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1810
translate chinese D7_Morgana_b358da7e:

    # ella "Is he present?"
    ella "他在吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1812
translate chinese D7_Morgana_48ec51a2:

    # klop_maria "I'm very sorry, Mistress. [theDirector] is very busy. He isn't taking visitors right now."
    klop_maria "非常抱歉，夫人。[theDirector]很忙，现在不见客。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1814
translate chinese D7_Morgana_4e8a76b2:

    # ella "Oh, I'm sure he can make time for his wife."
    ella "哦，我相信他总能抽出时间见妻子。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1820
translate chinese D7_Morgana_e7e41dc3:

    # "Without waiting for permission, she strode forward, pressing her hands against the grand double doors."
    "她没等许可就大步上前，双手抵住那扇气派的双开门。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1822
translate chinese D7_Morgana_9243e15a:

    # "The heavy wood barely budged at first, as if resisting her intrusion, but with a firm push, they parted with a deep, resonant creak."
    "厚重的木门起初纹丝不动，仿佛在抗拒她的闯入；可她用力一推，门扇便伴着低沉悠长的吱呀声分开。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1823
translate chinese D7_Morgana_c554e75c:

    # "A dim, authoritative presence loomed beyond the threshold."
    "门槛那边，昏暗之中透出威严的气息。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1824
translate chinese D7_Morgana_9529ba94:

    # "Waiting."
    "等待着。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1826
translate chinese D7_Morgana_99b2da41:

    # "The office was vast, shrouded in the warm glow of the huge corporate sign at the helm."
    "办公室宽敞空旷，笼罩在墙壁上巨大公司徽标投下的暖光里。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1828
translate chinese D7_Morgana_c695db18:

    # "[theDirector]'s chair faced away, turned toward the towering windows that overlooked the town."
    "[theDirector]的转椅背对着，面向俯瞰城镇的落地窗。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1831
translate chinese D7_Morgana_b340bc86:

    # "A thick silence filled the imposing office, broken only by some sharp tapping and mysterious rustling."
    "凝重的寂静笼罩着威严的办公室，只有清脆的敲击声和窸窣的响动将其打破。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1832
translate chinese D7_Morgana_5c80afd4:

    # theDirector "I thought I had told [klop_maria] that I was not to be taking visitors."
    theDirector "我记得我告诉过[klop_maria]，我不见客。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1833
translate chinese D7_Morgana_6afc02ed:

    # theDirector "I know it's you. Your heels on the floor betray your subtlety."
    theDirector "我知道是你。高跟鞋踩地的声音，把你想悄悄来的心思全出卖了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1835
translate chinese D7_Morgana_f2ad3693:

    # theDirector "Must you always ignore my wishes, my dear?"
    theDirector "亲爱的，你总这样无视我的意愿吗？"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1837
translate chinese D7_Morgana_c69321a9:

    # ella "That new Enforcer at [school_name]; he acts like he owns the place."
    ella "[school_name]新来的那个执法者……那副做派，好像这里是他家似的。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1838
translate chinese D7_Morgana_77feb08e:

    # ella "And now, he's taken [clarissa] from me."
    ella "现在还抢走了[clarissa]。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1840
translate chinese D7_Morgana_10795e41:

    # ella "The pretty little thing I scooped up off the street. {i}My{/i} assistant."
    ella "我从街上捡来的漂亮小家伙。{i}我的{/i}助理。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1841
translate chinese D7_Morgana_0458f871:

    # "A heavy silence hung between them before [theDirector] finally spoke, his tone measured yet cutting."
    "两人之间弥漫着一片沉重的沉默，随后[theDirector]终于开口，语调克制却锋利。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1843
translate chinese D7_Morgana_d1a02e27:

    # theDirector "You and I both know how you treat your assistants, darling."
    theDirector "亲爱的，你我都知道你是怎么对待助理的。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1844
translate chinese D7_Morgana_9fb76b1f:

    # theDirector "You know I don't approve of it. You take and take until there's nothing left."
    theDirector "你清楚我不赞同这种做法。你只会一味索取，直到把她们榨干殆尽。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1845
translate chinese D7_Morgana_8b795336:

    # theDirector "Perhaps it's simply your turn to be on the losing end."
    theDirector "或许这次轮到你输了。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1846
translate chinese D7_Morgana_513c24aa:

    # theDirector "Balance. Give and take. You know this. That's what we strive for. That's what we've built."
    theDirector "平衡。有来有往。你懂的。这就是我们的追求，也是我们亲手建立的东西。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1847
translate chinese D7_Morgana_625e764c:

    # "From below his chair, a soft shuffling sound stirred the quiet."
    "椅子下方传来轻微的摩擦声。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1848
translate chinese D7_Morgana_ce6aa22b:

    # theDirector "That'll do for now."
    theDirector "暂时就这样吧。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1851
translate chinese D7_Morgana_58c0a243:

    # "A girl suddenly emerged from beneath the desk."
    "一个女孩突然从办公桌下钻出。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1853
translate chinese D7_Morgana_727208c9:

    # "White residue still clung to the edge of her mouth as she wipes the corner of her lips."
    "她擦着嘴角，唇边还挂着白色的残渍。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1854
translate chinese D7_Morgana_1205abfa:

    # girl "Yes, Master."
    girl "是的，主人。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1860
translate chinese D7_Morgana_49e1175c:

    # "Rather than leaving, she stepped to the side, hands neatly folded in front of her, awaiting further instruction while licking her lips, swallowing all that remained."
    "她没有离开，而是退到一旁，双手整齐交叠在身前，一边舔着嘴唇咽下残余，一边等待指示。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1861
translate chinese D7_Morgana_f236db27:

    # ella "These whores aren't for personal pleasure."
    ella "这些婊子可不是用来取乐的。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1863
translate chinese D7_Morgana_caa89f3d:

    # ella "They're meant to be trained for the country. The people that pay us for them."
    ella "她们要为国家接受训练，为付钱给我们的人服务。"

# game/Days/daySeven.rpy:1865
translate chinese D7_Morgana_76891dd5:

    # theDirector "You forget yourself, honey."
